      symbols and any non-Wild symbol are\n  multiplied by both multiplier values.\n-
      \"Any One\" Wild Multiplier pay is awarded for symbol combinations with\n  a
      Wild Multiplier that do not form a win."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_DOUBLE_DICE
    value: <style=title><size=42>DOUBLE DICE BONUS
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_DOUBLE_DICE
    value: "<size=24>- During Base Game, 3 or more             sub-symbols in any
      position triggers \n  the DOUBLE DICE BONUS. \n- Roll 2 dice and win amounts
      according to the sum of the rolled dice.\n- A sum of 7 ends the Bonus.\n- 4
      sums of 12 awards JACKPOT or 1000x Total Bet."
